  "workflows": [
    {
      "key": "shot",
      "name": "Shot Director",
      "description": "Direct a cinematic take from one still: pick an open camera preset, describe the shot, and render it on Comfy Cloud with a pinned Wan 2.2 workflow. Every take records its preset, prompt, seed and Comfy job id.",
      "sourceId": "nodetool-base/Shot Director",
      "graph": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "intro",
            "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
            "data": {
              "comment": "# Shot Director\n\nTurn one still into a directed cinematic take on **Comfy Cloud**.\n\n1. **Source Image**, **Camera Move**, **Direction** and **Seed** feed **Compose Shot**, which looks up the open camera preset (`packages/presets/catalog/camera`) and writes the effective prompt plus a run-settings record.\n2. **Run on Comfy Cloud** submits a pinned ComfyUI API workflow (Wan 2.2 TI2V 5B, core ComfyUI nodes only) through the Comfy API v2 SDK. Needs `COMFY_API_KEY`.\n3. The take is saved as a video asset. **Comfy Job** carries the job id and output manifest.\n\nOpen weights: Wan 2.2 (Apache-2.0). No partner nodes."
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 40,
              "y": -260
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "source",
            "type": "nodetool.input.ImageInput",
            "data": {
              "name": "source_image",
              "value": {
                "type": "image",
                "uri": "package://nodetool-base/recipe-inputs/coffee.jpg",
                "asset_id": null,
                "data": null,
                "metadata": null
              },
              "description": "The still to direct. Landscape works best (rendered at 1280x704)."
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 40,
              "y": 40
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "camera_move",
            "type": "nodetool.input.SelectInput",
            "data": {
              "name": "camera_move",
              "value": "dolly in",
              "options": [
                "dolly in",
                "orbit",
                "crane up",
                "pull back reveal",
                "handheld",
                "static"
              ],
              "enum_type_name": "shot_director_move",
              "description": "The camera preset for this take."
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 40,
              "y": 300
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "direction",
            "type": "nodetool.input.StringInput",
            "data": {
              "name": "direction",
              "value": "Warm steam rises gently from the ceramic cup under soft morning window light.",
              "description": "What happens in the frame, the mood and the light.",
              "line_mode": "multi_line"
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 40,
              "y": 460
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "seed",
            "type": "nodetool.input.IntegerInput",
            "data": {
              "name": "seed",
              "value": 42,
              "min": 0,
              "max": 2147483647,
              "description": "Same seed and settings reproduce the same take."
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 40,
              "y": 640
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "compose",
            "type": "nodetool.code.Code",
            "data": {
              "code": "const PRESETS = {\n  \"dolly in\": {\n    \"id\": \"camera.dolly-in\",\n    \"version\": 1,\n    \"prompt\": \"The camera glides forward toward the subject in one continuous movement. Nearby objects slide past faster than the distant background as the subject grows larger. One continuous shot.\"\n  },\n  \"orbit\": {\n    \"id\": \"camera.orbit\",\n    \"version\": 1,\n    \"prompt\": \"The camera circles all the way around the subject at a steady height and distance, revealing front, side, back and front again in a continuous shot. One continuous shot.\"\n  },\n  \"crane up\": {\n    \"id\": \"camera.crane-up\",\n    \"version\": 1,\n    \"prompt\": \"The camera lifts above the subject and gradually points downward. More of the surrounding ground becomes visible as the subject recedes below. One continuous shot.\"\n  },\n  \"pull back reveal\": {\n    \"id\": \"camera.pull-back-reveal\",\n    \"version\": 1,\n    \"prompt\": \"Beginning close to the subject, the camera retreats smoothly into a wide shot. Surrounding scenery progressively enters at the edges and reveals the larger setting. One continuous shot.\"\n  },\n  \"handheld\": {\n    \"id\": \"camera.handheld\",\n    \"version\": 1,\n    \"prompt\": \"Small irregular camera movements drift gently up, down and sideways, like a person holding a camera while standing still. The subject remains clearly visible. One continuous shot.\"\n  },\n  \"static\": {\n    \"id\": \"camera.static\",\n    \"version\": 1,\n    \"prompt\": \"The camera holds exactly the same viewpoint and framing throughout the shot. Motion belongs to the subject and the environment inside the stationary frame. One continuous shot.\"\n  }\n};\nconst move = String(inputs.camera_move ?? \"\").trim();\nconst preset = PRESETS[move];\nif (!preset) throw new Error(`Unknown camera move \"${move}\". Pick one of: ${Object.keys(PRESETS).join(\", \")}.`);\nconst direction = String(inputs.direction ?? \"\").trim();\nif (direction.length > 600) throw new Error(\"Direction must be 600 characters or fewer.\");\nconst seed = Number.isInteger(inputs.seed) ? inputs.seed : 42;\nconst prompt = [direction, preset.prompt].filter(Boolean).join(\" \");\nconst settings = {\n  schemaVersion: 1,\n  app: \"shot-director\",\n  preset: { id: preset.id, version: preset.version, name: move, family: \"local-wan\" },\n  direction,\n  effectivePrompt: prompt,\n  seed,\n  backend: \"comfy-cloud\",\n  model: \"wan2.2_ti2v_5B_fp16\",\n  resolution: \"1280x704\",\n  frames: 121,\n  fps: 24\n};\nawait output(\"prompt\", prompt);\nawait output(\"seed\", seed);\nawait output(\"run_settings\", JSON.stringify(settings, null, 2));\n"
            },
            "dynamic_properties": {
              "camera_move": "",
              "direction": "",
              "seed": 0
            },
            "dynamic_inputs": {
              "camera_move": {
                "type": {
                  "type": "str"
                }
              },
              "direction": {
                "type": {
                  "type": "str"
                }
              },
              "seed": {
                "type": {
                  "type": "int"
                }
              }
            },
            "dynamic_outputs": {
              "prompt": {
                "type": "str",
                "type_args": [],
                "optional": false
              },
              "seed": {
                "type": "int",
                "type_args": [],
                "optional": false
              },
              "run_settings": {
                "type": "str",
                "type_args": [],
                "optional": false
              }
            },
            "sync_mode": "on_all",
            "ui_properties": {
              "title": "Compose Shot"
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 380,
              "y": 300
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "comfy",
            "type": "lib.comfy.RunWorkflowOnCloud",
            "data": {
              "workflow": "{\n  \"3\": {\n    \"class_type\": \"KSampler\",\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"seed\": 42,\n      \"steps\": 20,\n      \"cfg\": 5,\n      \"sampler_name\": \"uni_pc\",\n      \"scheduler\": \"simple\",\n      \"denoise\": 1,\n      \"model\": [\n        \"48\",\n        0\n      ],\n      \"positive\": [\n        \"6\",\n        0\n      ],\n      \"negative\": [\n        \"7\",\n        0\n      ],\n      \"latent_image\": [\n        \"55\",\n        0\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"6\": {\n    \"class_type\": \"CLIPTextEncode\",\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"text\": \"A cinematic shot.\",\n      \"clip\": [\n        \"38\",\n        0\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"7\": {\n    \"class_type\": \"CLIPTextEncode\",\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"text\": \"blurry, low quality, distorted, deformed, flicker, watermark, text, subtitles, jump cut, static frame, overexposed\",\n      \"clip\": [\n        \"38\",\n        0\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"8\": {\n    \"class_type\": \"VAEDecode\",\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"samples\": [\n        \"3\",\n        0\n      ],\n      \"vae\": [\n        \"39\",\n        0\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"37\": {\n    \"class_type\": \"UNETLoader\",\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"unet_name\": \"wan2.2_ti2v_5B_fp16.safetensors\",\n      \"weight_dtype\": \"default\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"38\": {\n    \"class_type\": \"CLIPLoader\",\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"clip_name\": \"umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors\",\n      \"type\": \"wan\",\n      \"device\": \"default\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"39\": {\n    \"class_type\": \"VAELoader\",\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"vae_name\": \"wan2.2_vae.safetensors\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"48\": {\n    \"class_type\": \"ModelSamplingSD3\",\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"shift\": 8,\n      \"model\": [\n        \"37\",\n        0\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"55\": {\n    \"class_type\": \"Wan22ImageToVideoLatent\",\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"width\": 1280,\n      \"height\": 704,\n      \"length\": 121,\n      \"batch_size\": 1,\n      \"vae\": [\n        \"39\",\n        0\n      ],\n      \"start_image\": [\n        \"56\",\n        0\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"56\": {\n    \"class_type\": \"LoadImage\",\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"image\": \"input.png\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"57\": {\n    \"class_type\": \"CreateVideo\",\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"fps\": 24,\n      \"images\": [\n        \"8\",\n        0\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"58\": {\n    \"class_type\": \"SaveVideo\",\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"filename_prefix\": \"video/shot-director\",\n      \"format\": \"auto\",\n      \"codec\": \"auto\",\n      \"video\": [\n        \"57\",\n        0\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}",
              "timeout": 900,
              "previews": false
            },
